  "question": "PLAN R5.3 -- scratch PPO against behaviour cloning against BC-initialised PPO",
  "headline": "BC-initialised PPO is not intermediate between the other two arms. It inherits real competence and the optimiser destroys it within the first few percent of training, after which it is indistinguishable from scratch. Both seeds. The endpoint metrics conceal this completely: BC-init and scratch both finish at 0.00 on every row",
